d example, no product can be bought with two coupons, that is why the answer is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":". Fedor can choose any two coupons in this example."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"754D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/754/problem/D"}